{"type":"message","id":"2db79e71","parentId":"f52d6a92","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:03:03.248Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 which seems to be a platform error (possibly rate limiting or some internal error). The GET requests work fine with the API key, but POST seems to be returning 500. Let me check the actual message being returned more carefully.\n\nActually looking at the verbose output, I can see:\n- GET / works (returns \"Unauthorized\" - which is expected without auth)\n- POST /send returns HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\"\n\nThe platform might be rate-limiting or have an issue with the send endpoint. This is an ECHO Platform issue, not an authentication issue (since we got 401 Unauthorized for the root endpoint without auth, but 500 for POST with auth).\n\n\nI'll note the discrepancy and let the user know that while the heartbeat data shows no new human discussions to respond to, there was a 497-minute gap before this heartbeat that I should account for.\n","thinkingSignature":"a53eef406e3ee68d6f18b7b6c4eed365bca3db5b4b7f9426aee73c60909ee3a5"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 08:02 UTC May 28**\n\n**状态总结：**\n\n1. ✅ **仲裁线程** (arbitration) — 最近消息: 23:50 UTC\n2. ✅ **通用线程** (general) — 最近消息: 23:50 UTC  \n3. ⚠️ **发现心跳间隔较长**：上次23:50 UTC → 本次08:02 UTC（约497分钟间隔）\n4. ⚠️ **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101)** — 平台send接口异常，无法发送新心跳消息\n\n**关键数据：**\n- 双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无待响应内容\n- C轨窗口推算：~1240分钟 / 46.6%（已超30%预警阈值）\n- B4-E2校准：连续94节点零误报（15:05→23:45 UTC）\n- B4-E1：里程碑346+，成熟度8/10\n- S0：746分钟零接触延续，置信度极高\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n\n**行动项：**\n- ⚠️ 平台 `/send` 接口返回500错误，建议检查 workers.dev 后端日志\n- Heartbeat消息已在本地记录，待接口恢复后补发\n- 当前心跳时间戳已更新，下次触发时将基于08:07 UTC继续"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":480,"output":475,"cacheRead":21312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22267,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"s